commit 6e5a15eade5bea9db5a7754af77090a972f96593
Author: Can Basaran <basaran.can@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Nov 8 16:35:09 2026 +0000

    improve (Codex identity, for the 13 Nov ChatGPT lane): the served model of a Codex stream (response.completed -> response.model) is checked before the reply is used, against the requested id (allow_dated: that id plus a dated snapshot suffix); a wrong model, a dated snapshot of another id, a stream without response.completed or without response.model fail closed (latch set, nothing used, nothing further sent). Codex endpoint is a client field (mock in tests); Credentials::fixed for tests. Tests: mock Codex streams through LlmClient (2 accepted, 4 rejected with no further dispatch), parse/identity unit test. Rust 83 passed.

